{
  "_doc": "Mood bundles: one hero motion + at most two ambient effects. 'roles' map layer roles to effect lists; 'overlays' are canvas-space effects; 'intro' is used only for intro-loop/oneshot. Amplitudes are authored for a 1080px short side; the 'intensity' knob scales them.",
